{"availability":"available","full":"Ryan87834/orderking","name":"orderking","description":"Production full-stack QR-code ordering & POS SaaS for restaurants — Next.js 16, TypeScript, Supabase Realtime. Live demo: orderking.uk","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":2,"created":"2026-05-19T17:30:48Z","updated":"2026-06-24T18:04:54Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://www.orderking.uk","topics":["nextjs","point-of-sale","realtime","restaurant","saas","supabase","tailwindcss","typescript"],"demo":"https://www.orderking.uk/menu/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/3","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T18:23:37.112Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T18:23:37.112Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T18:23:37.112Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T18:23:37.112Z","stars":0,"forks":2}],"technologies":["Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A production full-stack QR-code ordering & point-of-sale SaaS for restaurants. Diners scan a table QR code, order from their phone, and the kitchen sees the order appear live — no app install, no waiter, no hardware beyond a screen.","🔗 Live demo: www.orderking.uk 📱 Order as a customer (no login): Demo Kitchen — Table 3 — add items and place an order. 💻 See the kitchen side: log in at /auth/login with demo@orderking.uk / 123456 and watch the order you just placed appear live, then check it out.","Built and shipped solo by an undergraduate CS student, then taken to real Sydney restaurants for in-person sales. See What I learned — the most valuable part of this project wasn't the code."],"features":["📱 QR ordering, zero install — each table has a QR code; diners order straight from the browser.","⚡ Real-time kitchen dashboard — orders push live to staff via Supabase Realtime (Postgres logical replication), grouped by table, with a sound alert.","🧾 Built-in POS checkout — cash / card / bank-transfer, automatic card surcharge, public-holiday surcharge toggle, change calculation, and table-level bill merging.","🥡 Dine-in & takeaway — auto-numbered takeaway tickets (T01, T02…) that live alongside table orders in one queue.","🍽️ Self-service menu management — categories, images, prices, and availability, all editable by the owner."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Ryan87834/orderking/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"4ef3c48c482ef77eb66fa5a85a536fcd182bedfab51ddc2a8ec54e8f538a1c17","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T18:23:37.234Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T18:23:37.234Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A production full-stack QR-code ordering & point-of-sale SaaS for restaurants. Diners scan a table QR code, order from their phone, and the kitchen sees the order appear live — no app install, no waiter, no hardware beyond a screen.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Ryan87834/orderking/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"🔗 Live demo: www.orderking.uk 📱 Order as a customer (no login): Demo Kitchen — Table 3 — add items and place an order. 💻 See the kitchen side: log in at /auth/login with demo@orderking.uk / 123456 and watch the order you just placed appear live, then check it out.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Ryan87834/orderking/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"4ef3c48c482ef77eb66fa5a85a536fcd182bedfab51ddc2a8ec54e8f538a1c17","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Ryan87834/orderking/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T18:23:37.234Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-06-24T18:04:54Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Ryan87834/orderking/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T18:23:37.235Z","hash":"4ef3c48c482ef77eb66fa5a85a536fcd182bedfab51ddc2a8ec54e8f538a1c17","originalBytes":8121,"storedBytes":8121,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["table","order","supabase","menu","orders","live","checkout","kitchen","ordering","public","realtime","restaurant","auth","change","customer","dashboard","insert",